<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Indicate by check mark whether the registrant is an emerging growth
company as defined in Rule 405 of the Securities Act of 1933 (&#167;230.405 of this chapter) or Rule 12b-2 of the Securities Exchange
Act of 1934 (&#167;240.12b-2 of this chapter).</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: right">Emerging growth company <span style="font-family: Wingdings"><span id="xdx_909_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20260417__20260417_z4eJgcKZ31Qj"><span id="xdx_90A_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20260417__20260417_zGaZqxBwnZoa"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2026-04-17" format="ixt:booleantrue" id="Fact000051" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2026-04-17" format="ixt:booleantrue" id="Fact000052" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany">x</ix:nonNumeric></ix:nonNumeric></span></span></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

