has elected not to use the extended transition period for complying with any new or revised financial accounting standards provided pursuant
to Section 13(a) of the Exchange Act. <span style="font-family: Wingdings"><span style="font-family: Wingdings"><span id="xdx_90E_edei--EntityExTransitionPeriod_c20260417__20260417_zb4LXT0AQAVb"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2026-04-17" format="ixt:booleantrue" id="Fact000053" name="dei:EntityExTransitionPeriod">x</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></span>&#160;</p>

